.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/worktrees/

# Rust build artifacts
target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock

# SpacetimeDB local state — the daemon writes these as root from inside the
# container. `keys/` is the JWT signing pair (secret), `config/` holds the
# daemon-issued CLI token, `data/` is the durable database state.
/server/spacetime/keys/
/server/spacetime/config/
/server/spacetime/data/

